1
00:00:00,064 --> 00:00:02,394
(Penny:)Oh, Leonard.

2
00:00:21,544 --> 00:00:23,544
(Sheldon:)It's still my turn.

3
00:00:29,009 --> 00:00:30,759
(Penny:)What are you doing?

4
00:00:31,512 --> 00:00:32,972
(Leonard:)I'm packing up all my collectibles...

5
00:00:33,138 --> 00:00:35,598
(Leonard:)...and taking them down
to the comic-book store to sell.

6
00:00:36,225 --> 00:00:37,935
Is that really necessary?

7
00:00:38,102 --> 00:00:41,192
(Sheldon:)If you need money,
you can always sell blood.

8
00:00:42,314 --> 00:00:44,314
(Sheldon:)And semen.

9
00:00:44,984 --> 00:00:46,194
(Leonard:)It's not about money.

10
00:00:47,152 --> 00:00:48,442
(Raj(entering):)We brought food.

11
00:00:48,612 --> 00:00:51,652
(Howard:)Lox and bagels,
the breakfast of time travelers.

12
00:00:51,824 --> 00:00:54,494
Terrific. Anyone wanna buy
my share of the time machine?

13
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:56,620
- Why?
- Because I don't want it anymore.

14
00:00:56,787 --> 00:00:59,207
- Why?
- Just personal reasons.

